  "body": "The -webkit-line-clamp definition in https://drafts.csswg.org/css-overflow-3/#webkit-line-clamp needs to refer to the -webkit-box-orient property, since the legacy line clamping behavior only occurs when that property is \"vertical\".  Given #87 I think we just want to add it to the \"Property mappings\" and say it's a mapping for flex-direction (even though all of these -webkit-box-* properties are not really mappings/aliases), and not bother mentioning anything about the specific keyword mappings.\r\n\r\ncc @dholbert\r\n",
